ited;10 per state-modality condition', `extraSupport`: '', `limitations`: 'Face/gesture used as state differs from reactive face used as reward; intended teaching task, small action/state spaces; faces may be unrelated to robot in natural contexts.', `scopeReason`: 'Retain task-policy learning with feedback; no imported pretrained action policy is established. The learner/objective and evidence setting are stated separately.', `uncertainties`: []});
