ation-level evidence. The reported 28% reduction for the small task conflicts with Table II; use the absolute times.', `scopeReason`: 'Retain task-policy learning with feedback; no imported pretrained action policy is established. The learner/objective and evidence setting are stated separately.', `uncertainties`: []});
