ight episodes per condition per person; 18 hours of data collection reported.', `participants`: '12 recruited; Figure 3 reports n = 10 without explanation.', `extraSupport`: '', `limitations`: 'Interface, available feedback and decoding all change. Training performance includes advice; separate autonomous held-out testing is not established. Task-score penalties do not establish their use as learning rewards.', `scopeReason`: 'Retain as clearly labelled contextual evidence within interactive learning; its objective or feedback role differs from sequential task-return RL. This is not a recommendation to delete it from the survey.', `uncertainties`: ['Participant discrepancy (12 versus 10) confirmed in Figure 3.', 'A separate environment reward and Bellman update are not established.', 'Figure 1 caption describes an unrelated offline inverse-RL pipeline; do not infer that it was used.']});
