esult`: 'On Arrange-Boxes reports94% success and stronger performance than tested baselines; easier tasks allow AWAC to converge faster.', `finding`: 'Three seeds and autonomous tests; corrective actions are artificial.', `evaluation`: 'Three training seeds;100autonomous evaluation trials per interval; recovery evaluation100trials/method.', `participants`: 'Training operator count not specified; the separate timing study has two operators.', `extraSupport`: '', `limitations`: 'Human timing with artificial corrective actions; constrained tasks and predefined safety rules. No sim-to-real transfer claim. Simulated expert training is separate from the learner.', `scopeReason`: 'New task actor learned by distributional off-policy RL; pretrained perception and demonstration replay do not constitute pretrained actor refinement.', `uncertainties`: ['Numeric actor initialization is not explicitly reported.', 'Baseline implementations are modified; reported differences should not be taken as universal method rankings.']});
