ences.', `finding`: 'Above 90% reported; rolling training success, three seeds, demos retained.', `evaluation`: 'Three seeds; success averaged over most recent10trainingepisodes; intervenedepisodes count as failures.', `participants`: 'Training operator count not specified; the separate timing study has two operators.', `extraSupport`: '', `limitations`: '20demonstrations/task supply success labels and replay. Physical rolling training success differs from100trial simulation evaluation; two constrained lab tasks, human resets/interventions and sparse success detector remain.', `scopeReason`: 'New task actor learned by distributional off-policy RL; pretrained perception and demonstration replay do not constitute pretrained actor refinement.', `uncertainties`: ['Numeric actor initialization is not explicitly reported.', 'Baseline implementations are modified; reported differences should not be taken as universal method rankings.']});
