ial demonstrations; optional curated demonstration replay, targeted manual resets, human-guided exploration', `limitations`: 'Printed return-and-explore average 95% conflicts with per-task values averaging 90%. Prose claims universal improvements, but rice performance drops with two strategies.', `scopeReason`: 'PPO updates an actor already pretrained from teleoperated trajectories. This is the second category even though PPO performs genuine physical RL.', `uncertainties`: ['Reward-model freezing during PPO is not explicitly established in the inspected text; it is instantiated separately as the 8B evaluator.', 'Nearly 100 initial trajectories are stated, but allocation across tasks is not fully clear.', 'Do not quote the incorrect Table 3 return-and-explore mean or universal-improvement prose.']});
